    {
      "Original": "Slidecast Window Calibration",
      "Translated": "滑步窗口校准",
      "Context": "UI.Settings",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiEx.Text"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Switch between automatic slidecast window calibration or manually setting a value.\n\n\"Automatic\" mode is fully reliable, but will always result in smaller slidecast windows. You may also need to manually configure based on current spell speed or network latency.",
      "Translated": "在自动滑步窗口校准与手动设置数值之间切换。\n\n“自动”模式完全可靠，但滑步窗口始终较小。你可能还需要根据当前咏速或网络延迟进行手动配置。",
      "Context": "UI.Settings",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Automatic",
      "Translated": "自动",
      "Context": "UI.Settings",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiEx.RadioButtonBool"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Manual",
      "Translated": "手动",
      "Context": "UI.Settings",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiEx.RadioButtonBool"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Unlock at, s",
      "Translated": "解锁于，秒",
      "Context": "UI.Settings",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.SliderFloat"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Orbwalking Mode",
      "Translated": "走位模式",
      "Context": "UI.Settings",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiEx.Text"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Switch between two available Orbwalking modes:\n\n \"Slidecast\" mode is the default and simply prevents player movement until the slidecast window is available, locking movement again to begin the next cast. You must be stationary for the first cast in most cases. \n\n\"Slidelock\" mode on the otherhand permanently locks the player from moving while in combat and only allows for movement during the slidecast window. The movement release key is the only way to enable movement when this mode is used.",
      "Translated": "在两种可用的走位模式之间切换：\n\n“滑步”模式为默认模式，仅阻止玩家在滑步窗口可用前移动，并在开始下一次咏唱时再次锁定移动。大多数情况下，首次咏唱时你必须保持静止。\n\n“滑锁”模式则会在战斗中永久锁定玩家移动，仅在滑步窗口期间允许移动。使用此模式时，移动释放键是启用移动的唯一方式。",
      "Context": "UI.Settings",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Slidecast",
      "Translated": "滑步",
      "Context": "UI.Settings",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.RadioButton"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Slidelock",
      "Translated": "滑锁",
      "Context": "UI.Settings",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.RadioButton"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Buffer Initial Cast",
      "Translated": "缓冲首次咏唱",
      "Context": "UI.Settings",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Checkbox"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Removes the requirement for the player to be stationary when channeling the first cast by buffering it until movement is halted. This setting may cause strange behavior with plugins such as Redirect or ReAction, or prevent their options from working at all, be warned!",
      "Translated": "通过缓冲首次咏唱直到移动停止，移除玩家在引导首次咏唱时必须静止的要求。此设置可能导致 Redirect 或 ReAction 等插件出现异常行为，或使其选项完全失效，请注意！",
      "Context": "UI.Settings",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Block All Movement",
      "Translated": "阻止所有移动",
      "Context": "UI.Settings",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Checkbox"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Blocks all movement when holding down a specified key.",
      "Translated": "按住指定按键时阻止所有移动。",
      "Context": "UI.Settings",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Bind a key to fully block any character movement.",
      "Translated": "绑定一个按键以完全阻止任何角色移动。",
      "Context": "UI.Settings",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Bind a key to instantly unlock player movement and cancel any channeling cast. Note that movement is only enabled whilst the key is held, therefore a mouse button is recommended.",
      "Translated": "绑定一个按键以立即解锁玩家移动并取消任何正在引导的咏唱。注意，仅在按住该键时才会启用移动，因此推荐使用鼠标按键。",
      "Context": "UI.Settings",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Permanently Release",
      "Translated": "永久释放",
      "Context": "UI.Settings",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Checkbox"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Releases player movement - used primarily by the release key setting above.",
      "Translated": "释放玩家移动——主要供上方的释放键设置使用。",
      "Context": "UI.Settings",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Release Key Mode:",
      "Translated": "释放键模式：",
      "Context": "UI.Settings",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiEx.Text"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Switches the movement release key from needing to be held, to becoming a toggle.",
      "Translated": "将移动释放键从需要按住切换为开关模式。",
      "Context": "UI.Settings",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker"
    },
    {
