      "Context": "UI.Settings",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiEx.TextV"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Ground Targeting Hold (seconds):",
      "Translated": "地面选定目标按住时间（秒）：",
      "Context": "UI.Settings",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiEx.TextV"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Spells which have cast times that are also targeted on the ground (mainly found in BLU) register casting as the target appears, and will cancel cast times if moving as it's confirmed. This option forces your character to stop as the target appears for however long as to not cancel the cast pre-emptively.",
      "Translated": "具有咏唱时间且需在地面选定目标的技能（主要见于青魔）会在目标出现时开始咏唱，若此时移动则会因确认目标而取消咏唱。此选项会强制角色在目标出现时停止移动，持续相应时间，以避免提前取消咏唱。",
      "Context": "UI.Settings",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker"
    },
